<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - Nov 20.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - Nov 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  CATTLE	CALVES     HOGS</p>
